Ben Wang, Roman Griffin Davis, Josh Hamilton, Judy Greer, and Mark Hamill.

13
01:06:51,428 --> 01:06:57,428
Set in a dystopian 1970s, the film follows fifty boys in an annually
televised competitive walking contest, meant to inspire viewers.

14
