Each boy must maintain a pace of three miles per hour (4.8 km/h) of nonstop walking
for days, and failure to do so after three warnings results in death.

15
01:17:08,571 --> 01:17:14,571
The boy who lasts the longest wins a large cash prize and
the fulfilment of one wish of his choice.

16
